    "detailed_description": "\u3010Flying snow shoots the white deer, wishing to fulfill a dream in the martial arts world.\u3011<br><br>With the clanging of weapons and the sword in hand, we roam the world, striving to uphold justice in the ever-changing martial arts world. With cold garments and iron swords, we march thousands of miles; who in the world does not know of us?<br>Scholars and beauties, love and hatred, behind the flashing swords lies a hidden life of passion and affection. The ages-old saying &quot;Emotions only leave regrets&quot; holds true, as one pities those who turn grey before growing old.<br>Astounding events, stirring emotions, startling dreams, and heart-wrenching moments\u2014only after all these shocking experiences do we understand that this journey through storms is called &quot;roaming the martial arts world.&quot;<br><br>\u3010Game Features\u3011<br><br>Open-world and plot settings with freedom to roam the martial arts world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101720/extras/0e2f9ee5d9defd28fc2c40384f8044e5.avif?t=1732704245\" width=600 height=598 /></span><br><br>Relaxed gameplay mode with idle-style growth enjoyment.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101720/extras/f398e96c3d0ce490cc6770754e3d74dd.avif?t=1732704245\" width=600 height=1066 /></span><br><br>High character engagement, with full NPC recruitment and sparring.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101720/extras/1985779d1268e18927893be5e65dc483.avif?t=1732704245\" width=600 height=1066 /></span><br><br>Diverse companion combinations with highly flexible development and growth.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101720/extras/37bfaa1725da6b61c9b6eea38f8e4696.avif?t=1732704245\" width=600 height=1066 /></span><br><br>Many exciting features to be unlocked in future updates.",
